OL,3,GNEWSASteam trains to return to heritage
OL,4,Aline after rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage railway which suspended
OL,7,Fsteam-hauled services due to the fire
OL,8,Frisk during the hot, dry weather has
OL,9,Fsaid they will resume this week.
OL,11,FThe Severn Valley Railway (SVR) said
OL,12,Fsteam locomotives would return from
OL,13,FWednesday and meant its Autumn Steam
OL,14,FGala can go ahead from 17 to 20
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FBosses said the phased return to steam
OL,18,Ffollowed the "significant rainfall it
OL,19,Fhas been waiting for" across
OL,20,FWorcestershire and Shropshire.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
